# pulsar-trace v1
# clockRate=1789773 region=ntsc
# one second of a held A440 on VRC6 pulse 1: duty 7 (the threshold that makes a 50%
# square), volume 15, 12-bit period 253. same divisor as the 2A03 pulse — fCPU/(16*254)
# — reached without the APU's /2 divider, and mixed linearly instead of through the
# pulse ladder. enable ($9002) LAST: it latches the period's high nibble.
0        9000 7F
0        9001 FD
0        9002 80
# END 1789773
